@startuml ScreenFlow_GiaoDien_RutGon
title Screen flow rut gon
[*] --> LoginView
LoginView --> MainWindow
MainWindow --> DashboardView
DashboardView --> Kho : Product / Serial / Inventory / Stock docs
DashboardView --> HoaDon : PurchaseInvoice / SalesInvoice
DashboardView --> BaoHanh : Warranty views
DashboardView --> BaoCao : ReportView + truy vet
DashboardView --> QuanTri : AppUser / AuditLog / danh muc
MainWindow --> LoginView : dang xuat
@enduml
